WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.333
[TRShell boots: agent runtime, gateway, model profiles, terminals — ready]

00:03.333 --> 00:06.667
A terminal with an agent in it.

00:06.667 --> 00:08.000
It thinks.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
A plan before it acts. A model for every role.

00:12.000 --> 00:13.333
It works.

00:13.333 --> 00:16.667
Your real terminal. Every command in the open.

00:16.667 --> 00:19.333
It drives a real browser.

00:19.333 --> 00:22.667
Paste a screenshot. Watch every edit live.

00:22.667 --> 00:24.000
It delegates.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.667
Subagents on their own limits. A warning before it leaves scope.

00:28.667 --> 00:30.000
It recovers.

00:30.000 --> 00:33.333
When a command fails, it works out why.

00:33.333 --> 00:34.667
It remembers.

00:34.667 --> 00:38.000
What it learns about a target, it keeps.

00:38.000 --> 00:39.333
It reports.

00:39.333 --> 00:42.667
Every finding, written up as a report.

00:42.667 --> 00:47.333
It tells you when it's done. Reply, and it keeps going.

00:47.333 --> 00:51.333
TRShell. A terminal with an agent in it.
